Preamble: Real Illumination

This license is founded upon the shared commitment to the principles of Real
Illumination. By using, modifying, or distributing this software, you freely
pledge:

  1. To dedicate your mind to the discovery of knowledge;
  2. To dedicate your soul to the pursuit of enlightenment;
  3. To dedicate your efforts to the progress of abundance;
  4. To dedicate your existence to bringing all people, in all places, into
     unification;
  5. And to dedicate your life and days upon this planet to the protection and
     advancement of the human species.

This software is a component of the Engineered Universe framework — a
mathematical and computational civilizational stack developed to bypass the
scarcity loop and open the 5D data hypercloud. The torus belongs to humanity.

